" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">Scope Minimization</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="2"><a style="--toc-padding-left:2rem" href="#attack-description-9" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">Attack Description</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="2"><a style="--toc-padding-left:2rem" href="#risks-6" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">Risks</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="2"><a style="--toc-padding-left:2rem" href="#mitigation-10" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [