uide AI coding assistants through MCP server design and implementation\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/develop/build-with-agent-skills\"},{\"title\":\"Build an MCP server\",\"description\":\"Get started building your own server to use in Claude for Desktop and other clients.\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/develop/build-server\"},{\"group\":\"Clients\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Build an MCP client\",\"description\":\"Get started building your own client that can integrate with all MCP servers.\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/develop/build-client\"},{\"title\":\"Client Best Practices\",\"description\":\"Patterns for scaling MCP host applications across many servers and tools.\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/develop/clients/client-best-practices\"}]},{\"title\":\"SDKs\",\"description\":\"Official SDKs for building with Model Context Protocol\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/sdk\"},{\"group\":\"Security\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Understanding Authorization in MCP\",\"description\":\"Learn how to implement secure authorization for MCP servers using OAuth 2.1 to protect sensitive resources and operations\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tutorials/security/authorization\"},{\"title\":\"Security Best Practices\",\"description\":\"Security considerations, attack vectors, and best practices for MCP implementations\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tutorials/security/security_best_practices\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"Developer tools\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"Inspector\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"MCP Inspector\",\"description\":\"Interactive developer tooling for testing and debugging MCP servers, in the browser, on the command line, and in the terminal\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/inspector\"},{\"title\":\"Web client\",\"description\":\"A tab-by-tab walkthrough of the graphical MCP Inspector\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/inspector/web\"},{\"title\":\"CLI client\",\"description\":\"Scripting the MCP Inspector: methods, output formats, exit codes, and CI recipes\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/t